@startuml
' ============================================================
' CLASS DIAGRAM — SmartMart Koperasi Digital
' Fokus  : Backend Laravel (Controller + Model / Eloquent ORM)
' Cakupan: Modul Pengguna (Auth, Produk, Order, Pembayaran,
'          Poin/Voucher, Profil/Alamat, Simpan-Pinjam)
' ============================================================
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
  FontSize 11
}

title **Class Diagram — SmartMart Koperasi Digital**\n(Arsitektur Backend Laravel — Modul Pengguna)

' ============================================================
' KELAS ABSTRAK (bawaan Laravel)
' ============================================================
abstract class Controller <<abstract>> {
  + middleware() : void
}
abstract class Model <<abstract>> {
  + save() : bool
  + find(id) : Model
  + delete() : bool
}

' ============================================================
' CONTROLLER (RESTful API — sisi Pengguna)
' ============================================================
class AuthApiController {
  + register(Request) : JSON
  + login(Request) : JSON
  + logout() : JSON
}
class ProductApiController {
  + index() : JSON
  + show(id) : JSON
  + search(Request) : JSON
}
class OrderApiController {
  + checkout(Request) : JSON
  + index() : JSON
  + track(id) : JSON
}
class PaymentApiController {
  + pay(Request) : JSON
  + callback(Request) : JSON
}
class PointApiController {
  + balance() : JSON
  + redeem(Request) : JSON
  + convert(Request) : JSON
}
class ProfileApiController {
  + show() : JSON
  + update(Request) : JSON
  + addresses() : JSON
}

' ============================================================
' MODEL (Eloquent ORM)
' ============================================================
class User {
  - id : int
  - name : String
  - email : String
  - role : String
  + hasRole(role) : bool
  + points() : UserPoint
}
class Product {
  - id : int
  - seller_id : int
  - nama : String
  - harga : double
  - stok : int
  - status : String
  + scopeApproved() : query
  + decrementStock(qty) : void
}
class Order {
  - id : int
  - buyer_id : int
  - total_harga : double
  - status : String
  + calculateTotal() : double
  + items() : OrderItem[]
}
class OrderItem {
  - id : int
  - order_id : int
  - product_id : int
  - jumlah : int
  - subtotal : double
}
class Payment {
  - id : int
  - order_id : int
  - method : String
  - status : String
  + verify() : bool
}
class Voucher {
  - id : int
  - code : String
  - nilai_diskon : double
  + isValid(total) : bool
}
class UserPoint {
  - user_id : int
  - balance : int
  + earn(amount) : void
  + redeem(amount) : bool
}
class PointTransaction {
  - id : int
  - user_id : int
  - tipe : String
  - amount : int
}
class Address {
  - id : int
  - user_id : int
  - is_default : bool
}

' ============================================================
' PEWARISAN (Inheritance)
' ============================================================
Controller <|-- AuthApiController
Controller <|-- ProductApiController
Controller <|-- OrderApiController
Controller <|-- PaymentApiController
Controller <|-- PointApiController
Controller <|-- ProfileApiController

Model <|-- User
Model <|-- Product
Model <|-- Order
Model <|-- OrderItem
Model <|-- Payment
Model <|-- Voucher
Model <|-- UserPoint
Model <|-- PointTransaction
Model <|-- Address

' ============================================================
' KETERGANTUNGAN (Controller ..> Model)
' ============================================================
AuthApiController    ..> User
ProductApiController ..> Product
OrderApiController   ..> Order
OrderApiController   ..> Product
PaymentApiController ..> Payment
PointApiController   ..> UserPoint
PointApiController   ..> PointTransaction
ProfileApiController ..> User
ProfileApiController ..> Address

' ============================================================
' ASOSIASI antar-Model
' ============================================================
User    "1" --> "0..*" Order   : memesan >
User    "1" --> "0..*" Product : menjual >
User    "1" --> "0..1" UserPoint
User    "1" --> "0..*" Address
Product "1" --> "0..*" OrderItem
Order   "1" *-- "1..*" OrderItem
Order   "1" *-- "0..1" Payment
Order   "0..*" --> "0..1" Voucher : pakai >
UserPoint "1" --> "0..*" PointTransaction

note bottom of Controller
  Seluruh *ApiController mewarisi
  Controller dan dilindungi Middleware
  RBAC (peran: anggota/seller/admin/delivery)
end note

legend bottom left
  |= Notasi |= Arti |
  | + / - | public / private |
  | <<abstract>> | kelas abstrak (bawaan Laravel) |
  | --|> | pewarisan (inheritance) |
  | ..> | ketergantungan (dependency) |
  | *-- | komposisi |
endlegend

caption Gambar 3.4 Class Diagram SmartMart (Backend Laravel)
footer Class Diagram — SmartMart Koperasi Digital | Modul Pengguna | Tugas Akhir
@enduml
